    <string name="about_body">CodeServer Go talks to a code-server instance over HTTP(S). It adds what a plain browser tab cannot: an app window that survives DeX resizes, kernel-level hardware keyboard support, self-signed certificate trust, safe-area aware layout and file upload from the device.\n\nNothing runs on the phone — no root, no Termux. Your code stays on the server.</string>
